  },
  "section": "3.337",
  "rulesText": "- Gain the Hit Point Die from the Core Wizard Traits table.  \n- Gain the Wizard's level 1 features, which are listed in the Wizard Features table. See the multiclassing rules in “Character Creation” to determine your available spell slots."
